// =============================================================================================
// Routing oracle: which semantic models did a persona query during one attempt? (PLAN §9.5)
//
// Run against each workspace-monitoring Eventhouse (certified AND sandbox: decoy hits only show
// up in the sandbox workspace's logs). Parameters are substituted by evidence/correlate.py (P5.2):
//   {t0}, {t1}  attempt window in UTC, ISO 8601
//   {upn}       the persona's user principal name
// Ground-truth (eval-gt) and heartbeat (eval-hb) queries are excluded so only the surface's own
// queries remain. ItemIds are mapped to model keys through evals/golden/models.yaml.
// =============================================================================================
SemanticModelLogs
| where Timestamp between (datetime({t0}) - 5s .. datetime({t1}) + 30s)
| where ExecutingUser =~ "{upn}"
| where OperationName == "QueryEnd"
| where EventText !contains "eval-gt" and EventText !contains "eval-hb"
| project Timestamp, WorkspaceId, ItemId, ItemName, ApplicationName, ApplicationContext,
          DurationMs, CorrelationId, EventText
| order by Timestamp asc
